  "_about": "GSTR-2B canonical layer - column mapping table (spec v1). To support a renamed portal column, add its spelling to the right field's 'exact' list. Names are compared after lower-casing and stripping every non-alphanumeric character, so spacing, hyphens, brackets and the rupee sign do not matter. 'contains' fragments are matched the same way (fragment appears inside the header). 'nth' picks the 1st/2nd... occurrence of a repeated header (B2BA/CDNRA repeat 'Invoice number' for ORIGINAL then REVISED details). 'required' = ERROR if the field cannot be found.",
